OL,5,G0600 James Martin's French Adventure
OL,6,     FThis time, the chef visits the
OL,7,     Fcapital city, Paris, exploring one
OL,8,     Fof the largest wholesale food
OL,9,     Fmarkets in Europe, before setting
OL,10,     Fup a cooking station in one of the
OL,11,     Fwarehouses to cook a dish using
OL,12,     Fchicken and mushrooms. James also
OL,13,     Fvisits the kitchen of the
OL,14,     Fworld-renowned chef, Pierre
OL,15,     FGagnaire
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
