OL,5,G0630 James Martin's American Adventure
OL,6,     FThe travelling chef arrives in the
OL,7,     FTexan city of Fort Worth, famous
OL,8,     Ffor its open-range cattle drives
OL,9,     Fof the late 19th century. James
OL,10,     Fgets in the spirit and tries his
OL,11,     Fhand at cattle roping, before
OL,12,     Fcooking outside the cattle
OL,13,     Fexchange. He also dusts off his
OL,14,     Fboots to take part in line dancing
OL,15,     Fat the world's largest honky tonk
OL,16,     Fbar, then discovers a riverside
OL,17,     Foasis to barbecue a few Texan
OL,18,     Fmeats
